@test: consolidate_city_info_as_markdown:
    > case: normal_case_2:
      ```
          city1 = City(
              name="City A",
              history="History A",
              economy="Economy A",
              cuisine="Cuisine A"
          )
          city2 = City(
              name="City B",
              history="History B",
              economy="Economy B",
              cuisine="Cuisine B"
          )
          cities = [city1, city2]
          result = consolidate_city_info_as_markdown(cities, "Country X")
          assert result is not None, f"Expected non-None result, got {result}"
          assert city1.name in result, f"Expected city name {city1.name} in result, got: {result}"
          assert city2.name in result, f"Expected city name {city2.name} in result, got: {result}"
      # Edge Case: Test with an empty list of cities
      ```